{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09565","headline":"初至西虢官舍南池呈左右省及南宫诸故人 · 岑参","name":"初至西虢官舍南池呈左右省及南宫诸故人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"黜官自西掖，待罪临下阳。\n空积犬马恋，岂思鵷鹭行。\n素多江湖意，偶佐山水乡。\n满院池月静，卷帘溪雨凉。\n轩窓竹翠湿，案牍荷花香。\n白鸟上衣桁，青苔生笔牀。\n数公不可见，一别尽相忘。\n敢恨青琐客，无情华省郎。\n早年迷进退，晚节悟行藏。\n他日能相访，嵩南旧草堂。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"岑参","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09565.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09565","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}